FreeCAD Launcher
===============

This project is an Electron + Svelte rewrite of the original Python
"FreeCAD Smart Launcher" by deltahedra3d:

    https://github.com/deltahedra3d/freecad-launcher

The original work is licensed under the MIT License and its copyright notice
is preserved in LICENSE.

Upstream FreeCAD release artifacts downloaded by this launcher are published
by the FreeCAD project at:

    https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD

This launcher is a Linux desktop helper and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the FreeCAD project.
